# Database / migrations

- Schema source of truth: `apps/api/src/db/schema.ts`.
- After schema changes: run `pnpm --filter @do-manager/api db:generate`, review output, then `db:migrate` locally.
- **Do not hand-edit** files under `apps/api/drizzle/` unless the user explicitly requests a migration fix; prefer regenerate + review.
- Persistence uses `@libsql/client` (file SQLite), not `better-sqlite3`.
- Enforce domain enums in application code (Zod + repository); DB columns are plain TEXT today.

See `AGENTS.md` and `docs/DEVELOPMENT_SPEC.md` §8.
